WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
The thing that is most beneficial is that many people here are at a very high level.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
At other events, you get speeches that are often self-promotional and a waste of time.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
You actually try to seek out the people who have the value.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
Here, everyone has value to bring to the table. I think that is probably the main thing.
